{
 "encounter_id": "00884",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can't concentrate on anything lately. I think I might have ADHD, because I've always been a bit like this."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks for telling me. Let's talk it through. What happens when you try to concentrate?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mind just wanders off. I start something and then I forget what I was doing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has this been a problem?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since school, really. But it's worse now that I'm working from home."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it only with work, or everywhere? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Everywhere. Reading, films, even conversations. I zone out. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How are you sleeping?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Badly. I lie awake until two or three in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any low mood or worry that could be contributing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I'm not low. I'm not particularly anxious either."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you taking any medicines at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just a multivitamin. And occasionally a sleeping tablet, I think it's zolpidem, 5 mg, but I'm not sure of the dose."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often do you take the sleeping tablet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Maybe once a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When I was a child I reacted badly to penicillin and I've avoided it since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Do you drink coffee or alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Coffee, yes. Six or seven cups a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's a lot, and it can disturb sleep and concentration. Let me check your pulse and pressure. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 78, blood pressure 122 over 76, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Normal. Let me ask a few more things about school. Did your teachers ever comment on your attention?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. My reports always said I was easily distracted and daydreaming."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That history matters, because ADHD has to start in childhood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So could it be ADHD? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's possible, but poor sleep and six or seven coffees can look very much the same. I can't tell yet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What next? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Cut the coffee to two cups, and aim for a regular sleep time. We'll see how much changes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can try. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it doesn't help, I'd refer you for a specialist assessment, rather than start any medicine today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
